{
  "name": "ondra-adapter-discord",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的 Discord 通道：Gateway WS v10（帧层以 DiscordSocket 端口注入）、Authorization 用 `Bot <token>` 且全程单点脱敏、单条 1900 切条、关闭码 4004 停止重连其余固定 5 秒。手册 §9.11 明写「无去重」——本包据此不建跨时间去重表，只保留「同 message.id 在飞行中即丢」的幂等占位。不注册任何路由、不占端口，连接与定时器全挂在 ctx.effect 的 disposer 上，卸载即停。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
